<title>POLAND: ZYWIEC TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 170.</title>
<headline>ZYWIEC TRADES ON KERB AT PLN 170.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>A kerb transaction in 17,000 shares in Polish brewer Zywiec SA at 170 zlotys each was struck on the Warsaw bourse on Wednesday, the bourse said in a statement.</p>
<p>At the regular session Zywiec traded at 163 zlotys in a volume of 3,832 shares.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
